th a random chance on hit to fire an extra pulse that knocks back and adds damage.\n\nHell Bane and Curse Bane are the two mob effects. One raises regeneration on the entity it's applied to, the other cuts it. Keres applies Curse Bane.\n\nImage: Separator\n\n## Mod compatibility\n\nJEI gets its own category for Starlit Factory recipes.\n\nBetter Combat, Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, and Apothic Attributes are supported when installed. With Iron's Spells you also get the Celestial Genesis, a spellbook that boosts Celestial Weapon Damage, cooldown reduction, and mana regen.\n\n## Notes\n\nConfig lives in `config/celestisynth/`. The client file has toggles for whether the animation system shows your arms in first person, which matters if you run a first person model mod.\n\nIf a weapon animation ever gets stuck, `/celestisynth animation clear` resets it.\n\nImage: Downloads\n\nThe maintained version is 1.21.1 NeoForge.\n\n  * Requires: GeckoLib, PlayerAnimator\n  * Optional: JEI, Better Combat, Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks, Apothic Attributes\n\nInstall it on the client and the server. Celestisynth is not client-side.\n\nQ: Do I need this on the server?\n\nYes. Celestisynth adds items, blocks, mobs and worldgen, so it has to be on both sides. GeckoLib and PlayerAnimator go on both sides too.\n\nQ: Is this the original Celestisynth?\n\nNo. This is a port of AquTheSeal's mod to newer Minecraft versions, maintained separately. The original is still the original — go give it a look.\n\nQ: A weapon animation is stuck on my character.\n\nRun `/celestisynth animation clear`. That resets the animation state without touching anything else.\n\nQ: My weapon isn't forging.\n\nTwo things to check. The six material slots split into three core inputs and three supporting inputs, and the positions matter. One item in the wrong slot and nothing happens. Second, the factory needs enough banked energy to cover the whole forge time, so feed it Heated Celestial Cores rather than amethyst shards.\n\nQ: Why can't I find Solar Crystal / Lunar Stone?\n\nThey're in craters, not veins. Solar craters sit on the surface in the Nether, roughly one per 85 chunks. Lunar craters are underground in the Overworld below y30, roughly one per 17 chunks. Both also generate in structure chests.\n\nQ: Aren't these weapons overpowered?\n\nYes. That's the mod.\n\nQ: Can I use your mod in a modpack?\n\nYes, feel free to include it.\n\n  * Icywhenhot — Port maintainer/developer\n  * AquTheSeal — original author of Celestisynth\n  * Meme Man and UnanimousVoid — original team\n  * Licensed MIT--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCelestisynth: Wishes and Hells - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge (https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/celestisynth)\nciteturn17search2 [wordlim: 200] Published: 7 months ago; Crawled: last month; Image  NEOFORGE 1.21.1 PORT                      Image FABRIC 1.20.1 PORT ... > Important note (1.19.2 and 1.20.1 only): Celestisynth's weapons are only craftable using the Celestial Workbench!\n\n#### Minecraft 1.20\n\n[Forge] 1.20.1-1.3.4 Latest release R 1.20.1 Forge Feb 27, 2026[Forge] 1.20.1-1.3.2 Latest release R 1.20.1 Forge + 1 Aug 4, 2025\n\n#### Minecraft 1.19\n\n[Forge] 1.19.4-1.0.0-beta-v10 Latest release B 1.19.4 Forge Jun 18, 2023[Forge] 1.19.2-1.1.5 Latest release R 1.19.2 Forge Jan 15, 2024\n\n* * *\n\nReport\n\nDownload\n\n  * Description\n  * Comments (464)\n  * Files\n  * Gallery\n  * Relations\n\n# Celestisynth: Wishes and Hells\n\n## 🔴 Project Status: CANCELLED (DUE FOR REWRITE)\n\nImage  NEOFORGE 1.21.1 PORT                      ImageFABRIC 1.20.1 PORT\n\n⭐ Report bugs on the GitHub page 📎 Join the Discord server\n\n* * *\n\n## About\n\nRevamp your Minecraft experience with Celestisynth! Unleash an arsenal of celestial-grade weapons, forged to perfection and boasting mind-blowing powers. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nworthlessblake's Pr